<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>This is the scenario you were meant to see first―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
'<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE> 800, April 7, 16:00　<STYLE ID="2" RUBY="じゅさつ">Jusatsu</STYLE> Arc [Killing by Curse]　April Sickness.'<PG>
Incidentally, '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE>' is the era name used in this world. In <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's world it is likely unfamiliar, but...<PG>
Roughly, there is no harm in thinking of <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="しよう">Shiyo</STYLE> 800 as around the year 2020 of the Western calendar in <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama's world.<BR>
These blue squares are scenarios you do not yet know, and the squares with pictures are scenarios you have finished reading.<PG>
Incidentally, END means the last scenario of that arc.<PG>
As the story progresses, these squares will increase. 
{PAUSE ""}
Please simply advance the story.<PG>
Along the way, you will not be asked to make any sort of choice.<PG>
Ah, and also, a short while ago you obtained something called a Reference, did you not?<PG>
That is reference material that lies a little outside the main story. It is what one might call an archive. 
{PAUSE ""}
I believe it will be of help in coming to know this world.<PG>
Even a Reference that looks unrelated at first glance may turn out later to be important information, so it would be well to keep it in a corner of your mind.<PG>
Now then, I will take my leave here for the time being. 
{PAUSE ""}
Should you need anything, please call me at any time.<PG>
Viewing the Reference from earlier, and any other support in this world, I will guide you through myself.<PG>
（On the scenario navigator screen, right-click to call <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="みか">Mika</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="たちき">Tachiki</STYLE>）<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "-1"}
{DELETECG "プレート,矩形1,日時,シナリオ1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\イラスト\立木三日2.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "立木三日" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MENUENABLED">
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
